{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40350","headline":"题广爱寺楞伽山 · 李琪","name":"题广爱寺楞伽山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善高天外远，方丈海中遥。\n自有山神护，应无劫火烧。\n坏文侵古壁，飞剑出寒霄。\n何似苍苍色，严妆十七朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李琪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}